<title>BARBADOS: CRICKET-INDIA 105-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V BARBADOS - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-INDIA 105-4 IN 2ND INNINGS V BARBADOS - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>BRIDGETOWN 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>India, 128 runs behind Barbados on first innings, were 105 for four in their second innings at tea on the final day of the three-day match at Kensington Oval on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: India 210 and 105-4; Barbados 338-4 declared.</p>
